  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-06-17T10:43:31.170Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As checking the avatar for performance stats takes time when loading avatars and there are many avatars (particularly around my friends), that use av3.0 extensively to show/hide avatars having those performance stats checked all the time is just unnecessary. I am asking for a way to disable that entire checking stuff. Maybe even allow doing that based on rank... that way I could disable it only for my friends.\nOf course when doing that the performance filtering can't work either. Those options would need to be grayed out then.",
